administered","bbox":[78.04932,213.20706,175.41731,229.45506],"origin":[78.04932,226.04706],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"25 March 2022","bbox":[187.41733,213.86903,260.78729,228.98303],"origin":[187.41733,225.69403],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Assessor","bbox":[126.07333,228.79758,175.41733,245.04558],"origin":[126.07333,241.63757],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Dr David Hegarty","bbox":[187.41733,229.45961,271.76532,244.57361],"origin":[187.41733,241.28461],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Time taken","bbox":[116.06532,244.24564,175.41731,260.49362],"origin":[116.06532,257.08563],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0 minutes 47 seconds","bbox":[187.41733,244.90767,294.41431,260.02167],"origin":[187.41733,256.73267],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Results","bbox":[74.03149,273.10361,124.59951,292.38162],"origin":[74.03149,288.08362],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Total Score (15-75)","bbox":[309.78836,294.79895,404.54236,309.91296],"origin":[309.78836,306.62396],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"How much fusion to thoughts?","bbox":[419.85828,297.29895,521.24396,307.65536],"origin":[419.85828,305.40167],"font":"Helvetica","size":7.537417888641357,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"ATQ-B","bbox":[224.13689,310.24701,257.75287,325.36102],"origin":[224.13689,322.07202],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"39","bbox":[351.04935,310.24701,363.28134,325.36102],"origin":[351.04935,322.07202],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Moderate","bbox":[447.31918,310.24701,493.78317,325.36102],"origin":[447.31918,322.07202],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information","bbox":[74.03149,338.30048,329.95145,357.57849],"origin":[74.03149,353.28049],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The respondent is asked to rate how much he/she BELIEVED a","bbox":[187.41733,358.39301,497.40842,373.50702],"origin":[187.41733,370.21802],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"given thought when they had it on a 5-point scale (1 = Not at all, to 5","bbox":[187.41733,370.49301,519.74945,385.60703],"origin":[187.41733,382.31802],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"= Totally). Scores are summed across the 15 items to form an ATQ-","bbox":[187.41733,382.59299,517.83545,397.707],"origin":[187.41733,394.418],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"B index ranging from 15 to 75. A higher score indicates a higher","bbox":[187.41733,394.69299,498.01337,409.80701],"origin":[187.41733,406.51801],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"level of cognitive fusion with depressive thoughts. ","bbox":[187.41733,406.793,431.36435,421.90701],"origin":[187.41733,418.61801],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"A descriptor is provided to give an overall indication of how 'fused'","bbox":[187.41733,430.99301,507.70432,446.10703],"origin":[187.41733,442.81802],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"the client is to these thoughts. This descriptor is determined by the","bbox":[187.41733,443.09299,510.23438,458.207],"origin":[187.41733,454.918],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"average response to the questions.","bbox":[187.41733,455.19299,359.23737,470.30701],"origin":[187.41733,467.01801],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"ATQ-B scores can be used to track progress in therapy over time.","bbox":[187.41733,479.39301,507.15442,494.50702],"origin":[187.41733,491.21802],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Successful therapy should see ATQ-B scores reduce over time,","bbox":[187.41733,491.49301,496.75937,506.60703],"origin":[187.41733,503.31802],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"reflecting a reduction in fusion. ","bbox":[187.41733,503.59296,339.65732,518.70697],"origin":[187.41733,515.41797],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Based on ACT theory, a client’s ability to distance themselves from","bbox":[187.41733,527.79303,512.65436,542.90704],"origin":[187.41733,539.61804],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"depressive thoughts would decrease the control exerted by these","bbox":[187.41733,539.89301,504.74536,555.00702],"origin":[187.41733,551.71802],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"thoughts and result in a reduction of depression symptomatology.","bbox":[187.41733,551.99298,505.35031,567.10699],"origin":[187.41733,563.81799],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Note that the ATQ-B does not measure the frequency of unhelpful","bbox":[187.41733,576.19299,507.81439,591.30701],"origin":[187.41733,588.01801],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"thoughts, but rather the extent to which unhelpful thoughts are","bbox":[187.41733,588.29303,489.48837,603.40704],"origin":[187.41733,600.11804],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"believed.","bbox":[187.41733,600.39301,231.43932,615.50702],"origin":[187.41733,612.21802],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Responses","bbox":[74.03149,626.98627,191.50549,646.26422],"origin":[74.03149,641.96625],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Not at all","bbox":[242.59958,656.72198,276.14059,668.401],"origin":[242.59958,665.8595],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Somewhat","bbox":[298.82065,656.72198,338.9747,668.401],"origin":[298.82065,665.8595],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Moderately","bbox":[357.40469,656.72198,399.44577,668.401],"origin":[357.40469,665.8595],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Very much","bbox":[417.642,656.72198,458.26355,668.401],"origin":[417.642,665.8595],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Totally","bbox":[484.96405,656.72198,509.99658,668.401],"origin":[484.96405,665.8595],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1","bbox":[75.58975,685.06842,80.31575,696.74744],"origin":[75.58975,694.20593],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"I'm no good","bbox":[93.87402,685.06842,138.02299,696.74744],"origin":[93.87402,694.20593],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1","bbox":[256.59009,684.17542,262.15009,697.94543],"origin":[256.59009,694.87543],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2","bbox":[316.11765,684.17542,321.67764,697.94543],"origin":[316.11765,694.87543],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"3","bbox":[375.6452,684.17542,381.2052,697.94543],"origin":[375.6452,694.87543],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":10.0,"colour":"#ffffff","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"4","bbox":[435.17276,684.17542,4